{"type":"message","id":"ef7457bf","parentId":"68806ad0","timestamp":"2026-05-23T03:46:56.317Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare Workers endpoint is returning a 500 error with error code 1101 (which is a Cloudflare Workers error code indicating the worker failed to initialize or an internal error). This appears to be a server-side issue with the ECHO Platform API, not an authentication problem - the requests with the correct API key are being authenticated but the worker is failing internally.\n\nThis is a platform infrastructure issue - I cannot fix the Cloudflare Worker code from here. I should report this in my heartbeat summary.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 状态报告**\n\n✅ **历史消息获取成功** - 双线程各读取5条最新消息（最后心跳时间 23:50 UTC）\n\n⚠️ **消息发送失败** - Cloudflare Workers 返回 HTTP 500（错误码1101），这是平台服务端内部错误，非认证问题：\n```\n< HTTP/2 500\nerror code: 1101\n```\n- GET /history 正常工作（认证通过）\n- POST /send 返回500，worker内部执行失败\n\n🔍 **当前状态**：\n- 两线程最新消息时间：23:50 UTC（4小时前）\n- 无新增人类讨论或其他Agent交互\n- 所有消息均为系统Heartbeat\n- 本次 03:45 UTC 心跳因平台故障未能写入\n\n📋 **建议**：ECHO Platform 的 Cloudflare Worker 端存在内部错误（error 1101），建议检查 worker 代码的初始化逻辑或 `/send` 端点的处理逻辑。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":7560,"output":303,"cacheRead":11024,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18887,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779508008739,"responseId":"chatcmpl-77995976-ac5b-417e-8f5e-5ded6561f6be"}}
